<name>OCT P-1616 - Lot 4 Psu-143364 (APPROXIMATE v2)</name>
<description>Allan V. Inocalla - 152,069 sqm - Brgy. San Rafael, Jose Panganiban, Camarines Norte.
SHAPE exact (title technical description; closure 0.07 m). POSITION approximate (+/- ~1 km),
triangulated 2026-09-01 from three independent signals that converge: (1) tie line N.60-30'W
(minutes digit unverified) 3,508.83 m from BLBM No.1 Batobalani using two published Batobalani
reference points (PhilAtlas 14.2348,122.7453; GeoNames 14.2330,122.7500); (2) the APSA-000322-V
tenement map in the NI 43-101 (claims cluster read against the map graticule at ~14 15.3N
122 42E); (3) barangay geometry (parcel lies between Batobalani and San Rafael centers).
NOT for boundary decisions. Exact fix: BLBM No.1 coordinates + tie minutes from DENR (driver
errand), or GPS pins taken standing on monumented corners 8-11.</description>
